BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Middle School
X-SOURCE-URL:https://ams.ashevillecityschools.net/asheville-middle-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260720T040341Z
UID:2d1b486c-275f-5c64-8af0-ba7a5b5b6914
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260514T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260514T180000
DESCRIPTION:This concert has always been on the calendar\, but was initiall
 y scheduled to be in conjunction with the AHS jazz ensembles in the audito
 rium at 6:30pm. However\, we have the opportunity to perform outdoors in o
 ur community at the Hazel Robinson Amphitheatre (Montford Park Players sta
 ge)! The Montford Park Players have Othello rehearsal that evening beginni
 ng at 6pm\, so we have had to move our concert up to 5:00pm. We will plan
  to keep students after school that day\, load the bus and take them to Mo
 ntford for setup\, soundcheck\, and will start the concert promptly at 5pm
  (to be cleared out by 6p)! They are allowing us free use of the facility\
 , but would graciously accept any/all donations. We may "pass the hat" fo
 r anyone who would like to contribute. Amphitheatre Address: 92 Gay St. 
 Asheville\, 28801Parking Info linked here!
LOCATION:Montford Park Players stage
SUMMARY:ACS Jazz Bands Concert
END:VEVENT
